      "message": "[error] Line 172: 🔴 `LastSync` is only populated during initial construction from `getDeviceList`, but this model is also refreshed through `knownDevicesChanged` (connected here). If refresh paths still rebuild devices without `getDeviceList`, `Device::lastSync` falls back to `0` and the new UI field disappears after any device update. Update `slotKnownDevicesChanged` (and any other rebuild path) to source `lastSync` from `getDeviceList` as well, so the role remains stable over time.",
